.TH FRDP-SESSION-AGENT 8 "July 2026" "FreeRDP" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
frdp-session-agent \- per-session X11 backend for frdp-sesmand
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B frdp-session-agent
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B frdp-session-agent
is an internal per-user process started and supervised by
.BR frdp-sesmand (8).
It starts the configured Xvfb display, injects validated keyboard and pointer
input, captures bounded framebuffer tiles, and handles the supported display
and text-clipboard IPC operations.
.PP
It is not intended to be started manually.  Session identity, inherited
control descriptors, display geometry, and readiness reporting are supplied by
the session manager through a protected environment and inherited file
descriptors.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B FRDP_SESSION_ID
Managed session identifier.
.TP
.B FRDP_CORRELATION_ID
Audit correlation identifier.
.TP
.BR DISPLAY , " FRDP_DISPLAY"
Allocated X11 display.
.TP
.B FRDP_GEOMETRY
Xvfb screen geometry.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR frdpd (8),
.BR frdp-sesmand (8),
.BR Xvfb (1)
